{
  "title": "Voyager — Service Overview",
  "description": "D2 from 01-PRD.md § 7: the RED signals for all nine Voyager services plus the four mocks, the service map, and the container resources underneath them.\n\nThe request/error/latency widgets query APM trace metrics, which Datadog derives automatically from entry-point spans. The entry-point span name depends on the runtime, not on the service, which is why the RED section is split three ways: `fastify.request` for the Node services (gateway, loyalty, and the four mocks), `fastapi.request` for the Python services (booking, payment, notifications, ai-support), and `http.request` for the Go services (search, pricing). See 02-TECH-STACK.md § 5.2. Merging them into one widget is not possible — trace metrics are namespaced by span name — and guessing the wrong name yields an empty graph rather than an error.\n\n`voyager-notifications` deliberately has no HTTP latency widget: it is a Kafka consumer, so its work does not arrive as inbound requests. Its health lives on **Voyager — Data Layer**.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "defaults": ["demo"]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "defaults": ["*"]
    },
    {
      "name": "route",
      "prefix": "resource_name",
      "defaults": ["*"]
    },
    {
      "name": "user_tier",
      "prefix": "tier",
      "defaults": ["*"]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Voyager — Service Overview.** Start at the service map, then use the RED section for the runtime that owns the suspect service.\n\n`$route` filters on the APM `resource_name` tag — the normalised route such as `POST /api/v1/bookings`. There is no combined origin→destination route tag anywhere in Voyager; that is a deliberate cardinality decision recorded in 05-FUNCTIONALITY.md § 14.",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "servicemap",
        "title": "Service map — dependencies as traced",
        "service": "voyager-gateway",
        "filters": ["env:$env.value"]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Chaos state",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Chaos flags active",
              "description": "Any non-zero value means the stack is deliberately broken. Check this before debugging anything: `make chaos-reset` clears every flag and undoes its side effects.",
              "autoscale": false,
              "precision": 0,
              "text_align": "center",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "flags",
                      "query": "max:voyager.chaos.flags_active{$env}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "flags" }],
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 0,
                      "palette": "black_on_light_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 0,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Deployed versions — p95 by DD_VERSION (search, pricing)",
              "description": "Scoped to the Go entry span because scenario S6 pairs `version_override=v2-bad` with `pricing_hot_path=true`, and pricing is a Go service. A new series appearing here while the old one ends is the deployment story; the two lines sitting at different heights is the regression.",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": ["avg", "max", "value"],
              "yaxis": { "include_zero": false },
              "requests": [
                {
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p95_by_version",
                      "query": "p95:trace.http.request{$env,$service,$route} by {service,version}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "p95_by_version * 1000", "alias": "p95 (ms)" }],
                  "style": { "palette": "dog_classic", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal" }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "RED — Node services (fastify.request): gateway, loyalty, mocks",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Requests per second by service",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": ["avg", "max", "value"],
              "yaxis": { "include_zero": true },
              "requests": [
                {
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "hits",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastify.request.hits{$env,$service,$route} by {service}.as_rate()"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "hits" }],
                  "style": { "palette": "cool", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal" }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "heatmap",
              "title": "Error rate heatmap by service (%)",
              "description": "A heatmap rather than a line chart because thirteen overlapping error-rate lines are unreadable, and the question being asked here is \"which service is dark right now\", not \"what exactly is the number\".",
              "show_legend": false,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "errors",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastify.request.errors{$env,$service,$route} by {service}.as_count()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "hits",
                      "query": "sum:trace.fastify.request.hits{$env,$service,$route} by {service}.as_count()"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "100 * errors / hits", "alias": "Error rate %" }],
                  "style": { "palette": "warm" }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": { "include_zero": true }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Latency p50 / p95 / p99 by service (ms)",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": ["avg", "max", "value"],
              "yaxis": { "include_zero": false },
              "requests": [
                {
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p50",
                      "query": "p50:trace.fastify.request{$env,$service,$route} by {service}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "p50 * 1000", "alias": "p50" }],
                  "style": { "palette": "grey", "line_type": "dotted", "line_width": "thin" }
                },
                {
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p95",
                      "query": "p95:trace.fastify.request{$env,$service,$route} by {service}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "p95 * 1000", "alias": "p95" }],
                  "style": { "palette": "dog_classic", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal" }
                },
                {
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p99",
                      "query": "p99:trace.fastify.request{$env,$service,$route} by {service}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [{ "formula": "p99 * 1000", "alias": "p99" }],
                  "style": { "palette": "warm", "line_type": "dashed", "line_width": "thin" }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "RED — Python services (fastapi.request): booking, payment, ai-support",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
